OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786549694
OL,3,CDetails of review into shooting of 51
OL,4,Ccows announced
OL,6,FDetails of a review into a court
OL,7,Fdeprivation order that led to more
OL,8,Fthan 50 cows being shot in Co Tyrone
OL,9,Fhave been published.
OL,11,FAgriculture Minister Andrew Muir said
OL,12,Fthe review would provide an
OL,13,F"independent and evidence-based
OL,14,Fassessment" of the actions of his
OL,15,Fofficials.
OL,17,FDr Martin Blake, former chief
OL,18,Fveterinary officer for Ireland, has
OL,19,Fbeen appointed to carry out the review.
OL,26,@uD@AOUvD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/7
