PN,41202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786549694
OL,3,CDetails of review into shooting of 51
OL,4,Ccows announced
OL,6,FThe Department of Agriculture,
OL,7,FEnvironment and Rural Affairs' Humane
OL,8,FSlaughter Team carried out the cull of
OL,9,Fthe cattle on land near Fivemiletown
OL,10,Fin June.
OL,12,FConcerns have been raised by some
OL,13,Fpolitical representatives and farmers
OL,14,Fabout the public nature of the
OL,15,Fincident and Mr Muir has ordered an
OL,16,Fexternal review of the circumstances.
OL,18,FHundreds of farmers protested outside
OL,19,FStormont on Monday as Mr Muir answered
OL,20,Fquestions about the incident at his
OL,21,Fscrutiny committee.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786549694
OL,3,CDetails of review into shooting of 51
OL,4,Ccows announced
OL,6,FAnnouncing the details of the review,
OL,7,FMr Muir said: "The operation
OL,8,Fundertaken in Fivemiletown to comply
OL,9,Fwith a Deprivation Order in relation
OL,10,Fto a herd keeper disqualified from
OL,11,Fkeeping animals was a particularly
OL,12,Fcomplex, sensitive and distressing
OL,13,Fcase, understandably attracting
OL,14,Fsignificant attention and concern.
OL,16,F"Acknowledging the concerns expressed,
OL,17,Fthe complexities of the case and an
OL,18,Fongoing commitment to openness and
OL,19,Ftransparency, I have decided that an
OL,20,Findependent external review should be
OL,21,Fcarried out.
OL,26,@oD@OOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786549694
OL,3,CDetails of review into shooting of 51
OL,4,Ccows announced
OL,6,F"I am confident Dr Blake has the
OL,7,Fexperience and knowledge to lead this
OL,8,Fexercise."
OL,10,FHe added: "The purpose of this review
OL,11,Fis to provide an independent and
OL,12,Fevidence-based assessment of my
OL,13,Fdepartment's planning, decision-making
OL,14,Fand implementation of the operation
OL,15,Fundertaken on 29th and 30th of June
OL,16,F2026.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@JO]rD@KOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786549694
OL,3,CDetails of review into shooting of 51
OL,4,Ccows announced
OL,6,F"The review will assess whether the
OL,7,Foperation was conducted in accordance
OL,8,Fwith the relevant legal framework,
OL,9,Fdepartmental procedures and accepted
OL,10,Fstandards of public administration and
OL,11,Fit will identify lessons to inform
OL,12,Ffuture practice.
OL,14,F"I am determined this review will be
OL,15,Fthorough but not prolonged, so that
OL,16,Fany learning can be identified and
OL,17,Fimplemented quickly."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOUyD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/7
