PN,41206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786549694
OL,3,CDetails of review into shooting of 51
OL,4,Ccows announced
OL,6,FMr Muir said the findings and
OL,7,Frecommendations from the review will
OL,8,Fbe published "as soon as" upon
OL,9,Fcompletion.
OL,11,FThe incident has caused controversy
OL,12,Famong some politicians and farmers in
OL,13,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,15,FThe cull took place following a court
OL,16,Forder requiring the department to act
OL,17,Fafter a man was convicted of a number
OL,18,Fof offences and disqualified for life
OL,19,Ffrom keeping animals.
OL,26,@pD@NOUpD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
