OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786549694
OL,3,CDetails of review into shooting of 51
OL,4,Ccows announced
OL,6,FThe minister has previously said there
OL,7,Fwas "no reasonable alternative" but to
OL,8,Fcomply with the court order by culling
OL,9,Fthe 51 cows on the site.
OL,11,FMr Muir told the committee on Monday
OL,12,Fthat animals had been "essentially
OL,13,Fstarving to death" on the farm.
